        {
         "@type": "meaningComprehension",
         "comprehends": [
          "copies/dw479gk0103.jsonld#inscription-text"
         ],
         "note": "Pencil, four figures at the extreme treble edge, their tops shaved by the paper edge: [4 or 7] 9 2 4, i.e. 4.9.24 or 7.9.24. The first figure carries a crossbar over a descending stem, which in these hands can be either an open-topped 4 or a crossed 7, so I have left date_iso at the month. e2 carries the roll number 1263 in a smaller hand, clear of the edge; e3 shows the printed leader label WELTE-MIGNON No. 1263, Minuett G major, Paderewski; e4 blank."
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    },
